==German==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|de|nds|robbe}}, {{m|de|rubbe}}, in {{der|de|gml|-}} meaning “rabbit."  Of uncertain ultimate origin; compare {{cog|en|rabbit}}, {{cog|fr|rabot|t=plane}}.  Or, possibly related to {{cog|lv|rups||coarse, rough}}, referring to the whiskers.  Also compared is the personal name {{m|nl|Robbe}}.  Has also compared to {{cog|en|rub}}, referring to seals' movements, but this is unlikely.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʁɔbə/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Robbe.ogg}}

